          "date": "2026-11-23 19:17:34.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-18687 lnet: include cyaml.h with quotes",
        "message": "LU-18687 lnet: include cyaml.h with quotes\n\ncyaml.c and liblnd.h include <cyaml.h>, a header in their own\ndirectory. This only works because automake adds -I. to every\ncompile line. Include \"cyaml.h\" instead, so the files do not\ndepend on the include path.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I115e0d2e38f636bd7a8cde850c68908e6a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
